OL,3,GNEWSAAlstom to build new
OL,4,Abattery-electric train fleet
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to create the UK's first
OL,7,Fbattery-electric trains for
OL,8,Flong-distance main line services is set
OL,9,Fto begin in 2028, the Department for
OL,10,FTransport (DfT) has announced.
OL,12,FThe 29 new Adessia Stream trains are
OL,13,Fexpected to enter service in 2034 and
OL,14,Fwill be built at Alstom's Litchurch
OL,15,FLane factory in Derby.
OL,17,FThe government said the investment of
OL,18,Falmost #1bn would help support more
OL,19,Fthan 350 jobs at Alstom and a further
OL,20,F6,000 jobs across the UK supply chain.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
