OL,3,GNEWSAAlstom to build new
OL,4,Abattery-electric train fleet
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said the
OL,7,Fnew trains would deliver "faster, more
OL,8,Freliable journeys to the north and
OL,9,Fthousands of British jobs for the next
OL,10,Fgeneration".
